  (text "Mic: electret biased from MICBIAS via R312 2.2k, AC-coupled by C325 into MIC1LP; MIC1LM is AC-coupled to GND by C326. Speaker: PAM8302A from LEFT_LOP through C321, /SD pulled up by R311, 2-pin speaker on J506."
    (at 35 250 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.3 1.3))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "3a50d109-25f2-53b4-9282-9fb3b6830d97"))
  (text "TLV320AIC3104, pinout from the TI IBIS model. I2C 0x18. DVDD(32)=1.8V, IOVDD(7)=3.3V, AVDD(25)=3.3V, DRVDD(18/24)=3.3V. Unused analog inputs left open (see research note)."
    (at 35 35 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.3 1.3))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "3f6d04c1-0c3d-5a20-a93b-ced8140d93c4"))
  (text "This page is a pin contract pending full C1 audio schematic re-implementation; no fabricated analog values are implied."
